'''Crystal Shard'''{{Unofficial}} is a crystalize [[Spells|spell]] that creates several crystal shards.

==Description==
Crystal shard contains a central crystalize sigil surrounded by inverted column signs. It causes causes several large, shard-like crystals to suddenly erupt from the seal.{{Ref|m|18|12}}

==Usage==
[[Richeh]] once used the spell during the height of an emotional outburst which occurred as a result of [[Qifrey]] suggesting she study magic other than her own.{{Ref|m|18|12}}

